	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0001]"
				""
				"Good morning, Reclamation Operator. The world has moved on, and most of it moved away."
				"What remains is this fragment, one ruined NCP kiosk, and you."
				""
				"Your assignment: rebuild the North Central Positronics network, one tier at a time."
				"Nothing here has ore. Nothing here spawns. Everything you will ever own, you will &areclaim&r, &aprocess&r or &aremember&r."
				""
				"&eOpen this book any time with the quest key. Claim rewards with the button on each quest."
				""
				"&7Enclosed: one block of dirt for your botany pot. Do not dig up the island to get more."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:lantern"
			id: "504F530000001001"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 3
					id: "504F530000003001"
					item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "504F530000003011"
					item: "minecraft:dirt"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 2.0d
			subtitle: "Welcome to the Waste Lands"
			tasks: [{
				id: "504F530000002001"
				title: "Read the memo"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "The World Has Moved On"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001001"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0002: Reclamation Units]"
				""
				"Your kit holds one &bMk I Reclamation Generator&r. Place it and it slowly pulls cobblestone in from the void."
				"No power needed at this grade, and no, NCP will not be issuing you a second one."
				""
				"&aRight-click&r it to collect a stack, &aleft-click&r for a single block. It holds what you don't take."
				"Later, a hopper or pipe underneath keeps it emptied while you are away."
				"&7Everything else (gravel, sand, dust, glass) starts as this cobblestone."
			]
			id: "504F530000001002"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "504F530000003002"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Matter from nothing (slowly)"
			tasks: [{
				count: 64L
				id: "504F530000002002"
				item: "minecraft:cobblestone"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Reclamation Mk I"
			x: 2.5d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001001"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0003: Hydration Policy]"
				""
				"You have a &bthirst&r bar now. The island's spring never runs dry, but its water is &cdirty&r."
				""
				"&aStep one:&r fill one of your glass bottles at the spring (right-click the water with it)."
				"&7Do not drink it yet. NCP reminds you that dehydration is not covered by your contract, and neither is dysentery."
			]
			id: "504F530000001003"
			rewards: [{
				id: "504F530000003003"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Thirst, part one"
			tasks: [{
				id: "504F530000002003"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "minecraft:potion"
					tag: {
						Potion: "minecraft:water"
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Water Is Life"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001003"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0012: Purification]"
				""
				"&aStep two:&r place the bottle of dirty water on the kiosk's old campfire. After half a minute it is &bpurified&r."
				"Purified water is safe to drink. Boil a few: you will be thirsty again soon."
				""
				"Later, a &bWater Purifier&r does this much faster (it needs copper)."
			]
			id: "504F53000000100D"
			rewards: [{
				count: 2
				id: "504F530000003012"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Thirst, part two"
			tasks: [{
				count: 2L
				id: "504F53000000200F"
				item: "toughasnails:purified_water_bottle"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "Boil It"
			x: 3.75d
			y: 2.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F53000000100D"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0004: Thermal Comfort]"
				""
				"Your body has a &btemperature&r. Nights, rain and winter push it down; heat sources push it up."
				""
				"&aStay warm:&r stand near the kiosk campfire at night and keep dry. A roof over your head helps."
				"Later: wool armour (string from fibre crops), a &bthermometer&r (copper + redstone) to see trouble coming,"
				"and a Thermoregulator to keep a whole room comfortable."
			]
			id: "504F530000001004"
			rewards: [{
				id: "504F530000003005"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Body temperature"
			tasks: [{
				id: "504F530000002004"
				title: "Understood"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Warm Hands"
			x: 5.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["504F530000001004"]
			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0005: Seasonal Planning]"
				""
				"Time passes in &bseasons&r here: spring, summer, autumn, winter."
				"Crops planted in the world grow only in the seasons they like, and winter is cold."
				""
				"&aPlan ahead:&r store food before winter and keep a warm place to stand."
				"Botany pots don't care about the weather; crops in the open do."
				"&7A calendar (paper around a clock) shows the season, once you have gold and redstone."
			]
			id: "504F530000001005"
			rewards: [{
				id: "504F530000003007"
				item: "positronics:ncp_scrip"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Spring, summer, autumn, winter"
			tasks: [{
