			description: [
				"&7[NCP Field Memo #0008: Timber]"
				""
				"That dead tree on the island still has two good logs in it. Your kit has one sapling: do not waste it."
				""
				"&aPlant, grow, harvest, replant.&r Wood is your first fuel, your first tools, and your first workbench."
			]
